<%/* Branded page's expired state (UX brief §2, architecture.md §7): the page still
    resolves (no 404), it just replaces the embed/download with a plain notice. No data —
    deliberately undifferentiated between "expired" and "never existed" (no enumeration).
    Keeps the placeholder's original "הקובץ אינו זמין" heading (asserted by
    tests/integration/expiry.test.ts) alongside the UX brief's exact recipient-facing
    line ("הקישור הזה כבר לא פעיל").
*/%>
<div class="page page-share">
  <div class="share-card share-card--expired">
    <svg class="icon empty-state__icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-alert-circle" /></svg>
    <h1 class="share-card__expired-headline">הקובץ אינו זמין</h1>
    <p class="share-card__expired-text">הקישור הזה כבר לא פעיל</p>
  </div>
</div>
